<title>USA: Tescorp closes acquisition of TV SIS.</title>
<headline>Tescorp closes acquisition of TV SIS.</headline>
<dateline>AUSTIN, Tex. 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tescorp Inc said on Tuesday it has completed its purchase of a 96.0 percent joint venture interest in the assets of TV SIS SRL, a Argentine cable television service.</p>
<p>Reconquista Televisora Color SRL, a company in which Tescorp holds a 96.0 percent joint venture interest, purchased substantially all of the assets of TV SIS for $1.45 million, the company said.</p>
<p>The purchase price will be payable upon the fulfillment of certain conditions of the purchase agreement, Tescorp said.</p>
</text>
